ough like I want to help people I  want to create stuff that helps people  if I make this video and it helps just  you I'm happy with that  and a lot of the websites that's the  game like you have to create content and  use the keywords and put up stuff that's  gonna generate tons of traffic because  that's how you sell advertising and I  just grew increasingly dissatisfied so I  I kind of slipped my business up where I  gave the content part of my business to  somebody on my team and the advertisers  and all that and I started focusing on  things that I love doing the speaking  the videos the helping entrepreneurs  one-on-one groups whatever just stuff  that I was passionate about and as a  group two businesses grew kind of grew  and started going on different paths and  recently maybe six months ago I thought  you know what like I I want to stand for  something good I want people have a  great experience with my website I don't  want to just be in the advertising game  I want to really help people and so I  merged my website to come back and meet  me and so now there's no advertising on  my website and it just shut off that  business model as we've gotten a lot  better traction a lot better results  we've helped a lot more people how I  make money now with my site I don't do  coaching people want me to coach them a  lot it's just it's not the business I  want to be in so I don't do coaching I  make money from sponsorships so I work  with companies and help create content  for them so only companies where I'm  adding value so I don't want to work  with the company and say hey go buy this  phone because the greatest thing ever  right because that you know kills my  credibility and it doesn't feel good if  I feel gross doing that but I may work  with a company like Microsoft or Dell or  American Express and create content for  their website that is helping  entrepreneurs it's not just promotional  I have my own guides zuga guides and  these guides help entrepreneurs 