ey're gonna  go check out your website you have to  have stuff on there that engages people  video blog post tweets whatever it is so  you have to run those paths in parallel  you start creating your own community  with your best stuff stuff that moves  people stuff that matter stuff that when  you read you get excited about and  combine that with reaching out to people  who already serve your target audience  and showcase yourself as an expert you  just add any value you're not selling  anything you just add in value and the  opportunities will come right if people  see all this great stuff you're creating  you may not just be a coach anymore  right you may get speaking gigs you may  get media gigs you may get a book deal  you may get a clothing line you know who  knows all this stuff can come  but you have to pour your heart into  creating amazing content for your  audience to make them feel something and  say I need more Antoinette  you make that happen and you're on your  way to create a successful practice  believe who's your watching like the  video give her a thumbs up below let me  know what you think leave a comment ask  me a question below I'll make a video  response like this one and subscribe to  the channel by clicking on my face thank  you guys so much I'll see you soon
 

